{
  "rationale": "The plant is split into sensing and motion capability so the supervisor can react to uncontrollable obstacle observations before issuing one-shot motion pulses. The specifications encode a conservative but coverage-biased policy: random exploration in clear conditions, short forward progress after clear confirmation, directed turn recovery for side/front obstacles, and a rare full scan only after repeated front blockage.",
  "strategy": [
    "Use a total sensor plant for uncontrollable obstacle outcomes and a motion plant for available controllable pulses.",
    "Layer small deterministic specifications: one for exploration/recovery policy and one to alternate clear-state actions so coverage favors random_walk but still injects short move_forward progress."
  ],
